# MD trajectories and MM-GBSA byproducts. Regenerable, and too large to version.
#   reference.frc            194-339 MB per system, written by MMPBSA.py. Over GitHub's
#                            100 MB hard per-file limit, so any history containing one
#                            cannot be pushed at all.
#   production_full_stripped.nc  55-95 MB, produced from production.dcd by strip_traj.cpptraj.
# Both are rebuilt by scripts/run_mmgbsa.sh. *.dcd and *.prmtop above are excluded for the
# same reason, which is why these two patterns were the gap: they were simply missed.
*.frc
*.nc
